<p> 6   Equatorial Min	 127.78   0.23</p>
<p> 7   Westpac Prop Tr	105.00   1.68</p>
<p> 8   St.Barbara Mine	 91.55   0.65</p>
<p> 9   Tap Oil		   80.68   1.42</p>
<p>10   Consol Paper	    79.12   2.69</p>
<p>Lowest 10</p>
